:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Sic Bo Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-sic-bo-layout'>>
  <<set $_diceGame to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.sicBo>>
  <<set $_diceNames to {small: ['Small (4–10)', '小（4–10）'], big: ['Big (11–17)', '大（11–17）'], odd: ['Odd', '单'], even: ['Even', '双'], single: ['Single number: ', '单点：'], total: ['Total: ', '总点数：'], triple: ['Triple ', '指定豹子 ']}>>
  <<deadwood-casino-balance>>
  <label><<lanSwitch 'Chip value: ' '每注金额：'>>
    <<listbox '_diceAmount' autoselect>><<optionsfrom _diceAmounts>><</listbox>>
  </label><br>
  <p class='poker-summary'><<lanSwitch 'On the layout: ' '已选赌注：'>><<printmoney $_diceGame.stake>> · <<lanSwitch 'Limit per roll: ' '每局总额上限：'>><<printmoney $_diceGame.limit>></p>
  <p class='poker-fee'><<lanSwitch 'Select a position to place the chosen stake; select it again to remove it. Chips are deducted when the dice are rolled.' '点击位置放置所选赌注，再次点击可撤回。开骰时扣除筹码。'>></p>
  <div class='poker-table'>
  <<for $_diceGroup range ['main', 'triple', 'total', 'single']>>
    <section @class="'sic-bo-group sic-bo-' + $_diceGroup">
      <p class='poker-summary'><<switch $_diceGroup>>
        <<case 'main'>><<lanSwitch 'Big / small and odd / even' '大小与单双'>>
        <<case 'single'>><<lanSwitch 'Single numbers' '单点'>>
        <<case 'total'>><<lanSwitch 'Totals' '总点数'>>
        <<case 'triple'>><<lanSwitch 'Triples' '豹子'>>
      <</switch>></p>
      <div class='sic-bo-bets'>
      <<for $_diceBet range $_diceGame.bets>>
        <<if ($_diceGroup is 'main' and ['small', 'big', 'odd', 'even'].includes($_diceBet.key)) or ($_diceGroup isnot 'main' and $_diceBet.key.split('_')[0] is $_diceGroup)>>
          <<set $_diceParts to $_diceBet.key.split('_')>>
          <<set $_diceLabel to $_diceBet.key is 'triple' ? ['Any triple', '任意豹子'] : ($_diceParts[0] is 'total' ? [$_diceParts[1], $_diceParts[1]] : $_diceParts[0] is 'triple' ? [$_diceParts[1] + ' × 3', $_diceParts[1] + ' × 3'] : $_diceNames[$_diceParts[0]].map(name => name + ($_diceParts[1] || '')))>>
          <span @class="'sic-bo-bet' + ($_diceGame.state.bets[$_diceBet.key] ? ' selected' : '')">
          <<if ['single', 'triple'].includes($_diceParts[0]) and $_diceParts[1]>>
            <<icon ` 'casino/dice/' + $_diceParts[1] + '.png' `>>
          <</if>>
          <<capture $_diceBet>>
            <<lanLink $_diceLabel>>
              <<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.sicBo.place($_diceBet.key, _diceAmount)>>
              <<replace '#deadwood-sic-bo-layout'>><<deadwood-sic-bo-layout>><</replace>>
            <</lanLink>>
          <</capture>>
          <span class='poker-fee'><<if $_diceBet.key.startsWith('single_')>><<lanSwitch '1 / 2 / 3 to 1' '净赢 1 / 2 / 3 倍'>>
          <<else>><<lanSwitch 'Pays ' '净赢 '>><<= $_diceBet.odds>><<lanSwitch ' to 1' ' 倍'>><</if>></span>
          <<if $_diceGame.state.bets[$_diceBet.key]>><span class='gold'><<printmoney `$_diceGame.state.bets[$_diceBet.key]`>></span><</if>></span>
        <</if>>
      <</for>>
      </div>
    </section>
  <</for>>
  </div>
  <div class='poker-controls'>
  <<if $_diceGame.canRoll>>
    <<lanLink ['Roll (0:01)', '开骰 (0:01)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Sic Bo'>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.sicBo.roll()>><<pass 1>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>>
  <<else>><span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'Place bets you can cover before the dice are rolled.' '请先放置赌注，并确保筹码足以支付。'>></span><</if>>
  <<if $_diceGame.stake gt 0>>
    <<lanLink ['Clear the layout', '撤回全部赌注']>>
      <<set $LifeSimulation.casino.sic_bo.bets to {}>>
      <<replace '#deadwood-sic-bo-layout'>><<deadwood-sic-bo-layout>><</replace>>
    <</lanLink>>
  <</if>>
  </div>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Sic Bo
<<run maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.enter()>><<effects>>
<<set _diceGame to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.sicBo>>
<<set _diceAmount to maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.options.blackjack.bets[0]>><<set _diceAmounts to {}>>
<<for _diceValue range maplebirch.get('LifeSimulation').casino.options.blackjack.bets>><<set _diceAmounts['£' + _diceValue / 100] to _diceValue>><</for>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Three dice rattle beneath a covered bowl. The dealer holds a hand above the layout until the last guest pulls back their chips. "No more bets." Conversations break off as the cover rises. Nobody here has to wait for a turn to place a bet.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    三颗骰子在骰盅下碰撞作响。荷官把手悬在赌桌上方，直到最后一名客人收回拨弄筹码的手。“买定离手。”骰盅揭开时，交谈声戛然而止。在这张桌边，下注不必轮流等待。
<</language>><br><br>
<div id='deadwood-sic-bo'>
  <<deadwood-sic-bo-stage>>
  <div class='sic-bo-result' role='status'>
  <<if _diceGame.state.dice.length>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Last roll: ' '上局点数：'>><<= _diceGame.state.dice.join(' + ')>> = <<= _diceGame.state.dice.reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0)>><br>
  <<lanSwitch 'Staked: ' '投入：'>><<printmoney _diceGame.state.stake>> · <<lanSwitch 'Returned, including stakes: ' '返还（含本金）：'>><<printmoney _diceGame.state.payout>><br>
  <<if _diceGame.state.payout gt _diceGame.state.stake>>
    <span class='green'><<lanSwitch 'Net win: ' '净赢：'>><<printmoney `_diceGame.state.payout - _diceGame.state.stake`>></span>
  <<elseif _diceGame.state.payout lt _diceGame.state.stake>>
    <span class='red'><<lanSwitch 'Net loss: ' '净亏：'>><<printmoney `_diceGame.state.stake - _diceGame.state.payout`>></span>
  <<else>><span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'Your stakes came back.' '取回了投入的筹码。'>></span><</if>><br><br>
<</if>>
  </div>
  <div id='deadwood-sic-bo-layout'><<deadwood-sic-bo-layout>></div>
</div><br>
<<icon 'casino/table-rules.png'>><<lanLink ['Read the table rules', '查看牌桌规则'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Sic Bo Rules'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the room', '返回赌馆'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Life Simulation Casino'>>
  <<set $LifeSimulation.casino.sic_bo.bets to {}>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Casino Sic Bo Rules
<<lanSwitch 'Table rules and payouts' '本桌规则与赔率'>><br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Three six-sided dice. Small is 4–10; big is 11–17. <span class='gold'>Any triple loses big, small, odd and even bets.</span> A single-number bet pays 1, 2 or 3 times its stake for one, two or three matching dice. Totals pay for the exact sum; triples pay for three matching dice.<br><br>
      The odds on the layout show net winnings. Each winning bet also returns its own stake. You may place several different bets; each is settled separately. No additional table fee is taken. Choosing a high-paying position does not make it more likely to win.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      使用三颗六面骰。4–10 点为小，11–17 点为大。<span class='gold'>任何豹子都会使大小、单双赌注输掉。</span>单点按出现一、二、三次，分别净赢投入的 1、2、3 倍。总点数必须与三颗骰子的合计完全相同；豹子则要求三颗骰子相同。<br><br>
      桌上的赔率表示净赢倍数，中奖的赌注另退本金。可以同时押多个不同位置，各注分别结算，不另抽水。赔率高的位置并不会更容易中奖。
  <</language>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the table', '返回骰宝桌'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Casino Sic Bo'>><</lanLink>><br>
